WEBVTT

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.386
or to recycle them once they wear down.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:34.170
The race to zero needs capital.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:37.306
So we need more urgency
and directionality

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.170
in the financial industry

00:07:39.194 --> 00:07:43.740
because it is heavily
invested in fossil fuels.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.086
To reach scale and speed,

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:50.763
we will need clever combinations
of finance and policy.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:54.110
Look at what's going on
with electric buses.

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:56.256
China has a fleet

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:01.806
of 420,000 electric buses